  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22119408
    description: >-
      The DOI for version v0.1.1 specifically, the release that added
      findings.md, the honest account of what was built, what was measured,
      what was retracted, and what could not be established.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22125886
    description: >-
      The DOI for version v0.1.2 specifically, the release that replaced the
