  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22136735
    description: >-
      The DOI for version v0.2.1 specifically, the release that stopped a solo
      run reporting a stage that will never run as about to happen.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22139060
    description: >-
      The DOI for version v0.2.2 specifically, the release that stopped the
